==Battleground==
*3 [[Cerberus Kids]] (300%) spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
*5 [[Cerberus Kids]] (300%) spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
*7 [[Cerberus Kids]] (300%) spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cerberus Kids]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**6 [[Dagshund]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**9 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**10 [[Cerberus Kids]] (300%) spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**15 [[Cerberus Kids]] (300%) spawn, delay 5~6.67 seconds<sup>150f~200f</sup>.
**20 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
**30 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use the startoff to save money, while walling the peons off with your meatshields. There's not much going on, so you should be able to stall to max Worker Level. The enemies present on basehit have pretty high health, but it's nothing that meatshields, attackers like [[Paris Cat]] or [[Crazed Dragon Cat]] and Bahamut shouldn't be able to deal with.

